# BUGS

Realtek's microcode is not loaded: neither the MAC's patch nor the PHY's RAM code, nor the PHY settings that go with it.
The chip runs without them, as Linux's driver runs it when its firmware file is missing.
On the Orange Pi 6 Plus the link takes about 16 seconds to come up at 1 Gb/s.
The RTL8125, of the same family, isn't matched.
